<worksheet >
    <title>DC-4 Maxima and Minima</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>To earn an M on this outcome, you will need to show work, give correct critical points, 
      correct D values, and classifications. To earn a P on this outcome, you will need to correctly 
      give all partials and correct critical points.</p>
  </introduction>  
  <page>
    <exercise>
        <p>Given <m>f(x,y)=f(x,y)=x^2+3y^2-4x+12y+15</m>. Find and classify all critical points.</p>
    </exercise>
  </page>
</worksheet>